0260616-190708.png", "id": "996780976470939", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507840145_996780979804272_1401798199839706745_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wi2ayekkoLkQ7kNvwHDMdJK&_nc_oc=AdqUZ9n7q_RZvl-NVCIfLi_B6HrNDT5JWmTO6MmogJQfC6nl6qWnxD9WbG5diL1i1Jo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHeQUC9CF-ZZkXpAY0zIBcR9Rb2un2ffxmbyN1S0ifv7A&oe=6A971E27"}, {"file_name": "com.SimpleXRApps.BubbleWandsXR-20260616-191922.png", "id": "4441269006017106", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313107_4441269009350439_4724465559411699017_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RBhlmcxumhAQ7kNvwEeIQ2q&_nc_oc=AdpHITrG1xj3MWL1FQ4b0MLtypzTdqOHAUN2qWkqLDqZm_fej9eLaguQsWh7MttS6Js&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGHzDpTLHuLwschdQKEfP2MIfjtEn0vFEsPNsdGPdxfbw&oe=6A9739FE"}, {"file_name": "com.SimpleXRApps.BubbleWandsXR-20260616-191801.png", "id": "2224549311710160", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_2224549315043493_682054050875565401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=skLvDDBV8cQQ7kNvwFLD5KA&_nc_oc=AdosRMD5Ld8C2pNi6JFZmgwBD-UHiEMouD9KVs_lnQNWGT8zpoptAFwK7eHtytHLiQw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE7gA2QALIAiXmj6E3RnDhcz91aYTB1DiVU77MSENR8VA&oe=6A971B6A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Bubble Wands XR Cover Landscape 2560 x 1440.png", "id": "2137891396778295", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507845837_2137891400111628_5916190379357174670_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1U3nrftWgrAQ7kNvwGtGIbV&_nc_oc=AdotnHxvhPi5llekbT-Cuprz1k5RS1LJmkIoA2iTSmCvSwEOPeB1ORQVxE_MCrB81Ok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE_I6rVMeh3IGWhQnl0t819rCeRJdnGOSWgvNbNIUZpKQ&oe=6A97272F"}, "display_name": "Bubble Wands XR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Parents, for less than the price of real bubbles and with no potential for spills or messes, you can give your kids infinite bubbles along with the choice of four different wands each creating bubbles of different sizes.  The bubbles are formed by the bubble wands in the same way that real bubbles are formed.  The bubbles can then be popped.  Hands can also be used as an alternative to using controllers.  All of these features result in a realistic user experience. \n\nAs an added bonus, there are over 20 magic bubbles that your kids will love including a unicorn, a fairy princess, an elephant, a baby elephant, a lion, a puppy, a kitten, a rabbit, a kangaroo, a penguin, a dolphin, a shark, a frog, a butterfly, a dinosaur, a mermaid, a pirate ship, a race car, an airplane, a hot air balloon, a clown, and a castle.\n\nUser Tip: If your child cannot reach the green wand, have them sit down, select Play Again, and then stand up.  ", "short_description": "Parents, for less than the price of real bubbles and with no potential for spills or messes, you can give your kids infinite bubbles along with the choice of four different wands each creating bubbles of different sizes in the same way that real bubbles are formed.  The bubbles can then be popped.  Hands can also be used as an alternative to using the controllers.  All of these features result in a realistic user experience.  As an added bonus, there are also over 20 magic bubbles. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/bubble-wands-xr-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Copeland Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/bubble-wands-xr-privacy-policy/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "g